  "details": "There is a bug in unity 2019 which causes animator states/transitions to be blank in the inspector, this was fixed in 2020 but is still apparent in 2019.\n\nThis is a major annoyance and because we're stuck with 2019. This bug evidently isn't fixed in the current version VRchat uses there is no other option other than to use annoying work arounds which have to be applied on a per controller basis...",
